description:
Parses any CSS color (hex #abc/#aabbcc/#aabbccdd, rgb()/rgba(), hsl()/hsla(), optional alpha) and returns it in hex, rgb() and hsl() forms. The page at redbison.dev/hex-to-rgb-converter adds a live swatch.

Returns: Text: the color in all three forms. structuredContent { hex, rgb, hsl }.
Example input: {"color":"#ff3131"}
